  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Clicking a ribbon tab in the designer now switches the tab and shows that tab's page. Tabs are matched against the bounds the design surface draws instead of the ribbon's internal tab bookkeeping, which the design server can leave stale, and the tab strip answers the design server's hit test with a cursor so the click reaches the ribbon designer at all. The runtime API is unchanged from 1.0.4-net10.",
